      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should pivot the conversation toward long-term economic resilience and job creation within his district. Emphasize that the subsidy encourages domestic supply chains, which protects local workers from global market volatility. Frame the initial margin impact as a necessary, short-term investment in future self-sufficiency and advanced green technology leadership.",
